    "title": "Aperas-dev-status.md",
    "text": "See `Aperas-architecture.md` for how everything below is actually built (schema, CRUD, WOQL/GraphQL, version control, artifact ingestion, KG backup/restore, cross-machine remotes). **Stale as of the ApeironNgn migration** (see `Aperas-apeironngn-design.md`) — it still describes the now-archived TerminusDB implementation as the current system; migrating it to describe ApeironNgn is a deferred follow-up, not yet done.",
