  {
    "@id": "ArtifactNode:00CBFDW970000",
    "@type": "ArtifactNode",
    "title": "Aperas-deep-path-resolution-design.md",
    "text": "**Status**: both directions are **implemented and live-verified** — `kg:path` (id→path, §8) and `kg:resolve` (path→id, §1-7, including `--base`, `--create-holder`, and the `kg:tree`/`kg:search` backport in §7.5) — via `nodeRef.ts`'s `resolveNodeRefDetail`/`resolveNodeRefOrNull`.",
